<title>USA: U.S. soyoil weekly export sales highlights -- USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S. soyoil weekly export sales highlights -- USDA.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA soyoil weekly export sales highlights in latest reporting week:</p>
<p>Net sales of 34,000 MT were the result of increases for China (42,500 MT including 27,500 in new sales and 20,000 in destination changes), Mexico (3,500 MT), and Hong Kong (3,000 MT) being partially offset by reductions for unknown destinations (15,000 MT).</p>
<p>Exports of 29,000 MT were to China (22,500 MT), Mexico (5,300 MT), and Jamaica (1,300 MT).</p>
</text>
